WEBVTT

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:30.793
or perhaps because of them.

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:34.746
The lockdowns of 2020 have been tough,

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:37.586
but they also give us a glimpse of life

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:42.426
without the usual noise,
congestion and pollution,

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:46.870
confronting us with questions
about the way we live.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:51.756
The tailpipe is a symbol
of our worst habits --

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:55.506
habits that we have
normalized for too long:

00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:02.066
the burning of 100 million
barrels of oil every 24 hours